        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we offer training workshops designed to increase customer design proficiency and productivity with our products.",
        "start_character": 25859,
        "end_character": 25984
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000883241-25-000028",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000883241-25-000028-a4540fe47e966e2d",
        "accession_number": "0000883241-25-000028",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-22",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also deliver a significant amount of engineering and design consulting for our products.",
        "start_character": 33563,
        "end_character": 33654
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000883241-25-000028",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000883241-25-000028-a4540fe47e966e2d",
        "accession_number": "0000883241-25-000028",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-22",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer a broad and comprehensive portfolio of semiconductor IP solutions, which are pre-designed circuits that engineers use as components of larger chip designs to reduce development risk and speed time to market.",
        "start_character": 1994,
        "end_character": 2215
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000883241-25-000028",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000883241-25-000028-a4540fe47e966e2d",
        "accession_number": "0000883241-25-000028",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-22",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide consulting and design services that address all phases of the SoC development process, as well as a broad range of expert training and workshops on our latest tools and methodologies.",
        "start_character": 16890,
        "end_character": 17089
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000883241-25-000028",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000883241-25-000028-a4540fe47e966e2d",
        "accession_number": "0000883241-25-000028",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-22",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide technical services and support to help our customers develop advanced chips and electronic systems.",
        "start_character": 1194,
        "end_character": 1309
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000883241-25-000028",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000883241-25-000028-a4540fe47e966e2d",
        "accession_number": "0000883241-25-000028",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-22",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We compete with a variety of different EDA vendors, including publicly traded companies offering varying ranges of products and services as well as other EDA vendors that offer products focused on one or more discrete phases of the IC design process.",
        "start_character": 33798,
        "end_character": 34048
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000883241-25-000028",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000883241-25-000028-a4540fe47e966e2d",
        "accession_number": "0000883241-25-000028",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-22",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We deliver trusted and comprehensive solutions spanning silicon design, silicon intellectual property (IP), simulation and analysis (S&A) as well as design services.",
        "start_character": 211,
        "end_character": 376
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000883241-25-000028",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000883241-25-000028-a4540fe47e966e2d",
        "accession_number": "0000883241-25-000028",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-22",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, effective copyright and trade secret protection may be unavailable or limited in some foreign countries in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 35782,
        "end_character": 35919
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000883241-25-000028",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000883241-25-000028-a4540fe47e966e2d",
        "accession_number": "0000883241-25-000028",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-22",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also host in-person and on-demand learning sessions designed to build capabilities and adaptability required for the future.",
        "start_character": 44427,
        "end_character": 44554
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000883241-25-000028",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000883241-25-000028-a4540fe47e966e2d",
        "accession_number": "0000883241-25-000028",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-22",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are a global leader in supplying the mission-critical EDA solutions that engineers use to design and test integrated circuits (ICs), also known as chips or silicon, and we are pioneering artificial intelligence (AI) driven chip design across the full-stack EDA suite to improve efficiency and accelerate the design, verification testing and manufacturing of advanced digital and analog chips.",
        "start_character": 566,
        "end_character": 961
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000883241-25-000028",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000883241-25-000028-a4540fe47e966e2d",
        "accession_number": "0000883241-25-000028",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-22",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Within our Design Automation segment, we compete against other EDA vendors and against our customers’ own design tools and internal design capabilities.",
        "start_character": 33095,
        "end_character": 33247
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000883241-25-000028",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000883241-25-000028-a4540fe47e966e2d",
        "accession_number": "0000883241-25-000028",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-22",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "At Synopsys, we recognize that as we drive innovation and business success in the era of pervasive intelligence, we are simultaneously responsible for the sustainability of our operations, products and ecosystem, which may impact our long-term value as a company.",
        "start_character": 36710,
        "end_character": 36973
      }
    ]
